  "displayName": "PixVerse C1 Text to Video",
  "description": "PixVerse C1 generating video from a prompt alone.",
  "sortOrder": 71,
  "pricing": {
    "unit": "seconds",
    "unitPriceUsd": 0.05,
    "note": "720p without audio, the tier this entry pins. fal's prose opens with the 360p price ($0.030) and climbs to $0.120 at 1080p with audio, so the sync report reads a smaller number and is wrong about it. `genmedia pricing` answers $0.005, a base unit no request is ever charged."
  },
  "creditMultiplier": 1.25,
